   "first": 508,
   "line": "You are one of two small spacecraft.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S11",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 49,
   "first": 579,
   "line": "Your target is Mars.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S12",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 628,
   "line": "You cannot just point and go.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S13",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 684,
   "line": "You need Earth to do the heavy lifting.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S14",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 749,
   "line": "And you have one shot at it.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S15",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 81,
   "first": 801,
   "line": "Miss the window, and Mars waits two years.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S16",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 54,
   "first": 882,
   "line": "Or does it?",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S17",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 936,
   "line": "November thirteenth, twenty twenty-five.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S18",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 34,
   "len": 55,
   "first": 1011,
   "line": "You lift off from Cape Canaveral.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S19",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 26,
   "len": 42,
   "first": 1066,
   "line": "A perfect launch.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S20",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 47,
   "first": 1108,
   "line": "There is just one problem.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S21",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 1155,
   "line": "Earth and Mars are on opposite sides of the Sun.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S22",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 1239,
   "line": "Wrong side. Wrong time.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S23",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 62,
   "first": 1304,
   "line": "A direct flight would take forever.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S24",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 49,
   "first": 1366,
   "line": "So you do something clever.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S25",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 59,
   "first": 1415,
   "line": "You do not head for Mars at all.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S26",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 106,
   "first": 1474,
   "line": "You head for a spot in space, near home.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S27",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 71,
   "first": 1580,
   "line": "It sits about a million miles from Earth.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S28",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 1651,
   "line": "Straight away from the Sun.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S29",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 1699,
   "line": "Scientists call it Lagrange point two.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S30",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 61,
   "first": 1775,
   "line": "A gravitational balancing point.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S31",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 1836,
   "line": "Nothing pulls you in. Nothing pushes you out.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S32",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 64,
   "first": 1916,
   "line": "So you drift. In a loop.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S33",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 1980,
   "line": "A kidney-bean-shaped loop, to be exact.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S34",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 27,
   "len": 44,
   "first": 2048,
   "line": "The first of its kind.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S35",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 2092,
   "line": "You are parked. You are not stuck.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S36",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 96,
   "first": 2155,
   "line": "And Earth is still close enough to find.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S37",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 21,
   "len": 34,
   "first": 2251,
   "line": "Now you wait.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S38",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 2285,
   "line": "A whole year, going in circles.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S39",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 64,
   "first": 2353,
   "line": "No sightseeing. Just loops.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S40",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 53,
   "first": 2417,
   "line": "You do take a few measurements.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S41",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 61,
   "len": 99,
   "first": 2470,
   "line": "Out here, you fly through Earth's long magnetic tail.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S42",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 2569,
   "line": "The solar wind stretches it out like a windsock.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S43",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 2653,
   "line": "Then, one day, the timing is right.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S44",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 2725,
   "line": "Mars has moved to the same side of the Sun as Earth.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S45",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 2814,
   "line": "So you turn around and head home.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S46",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 2877,
   "line": "Not to land. To skim past.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S47",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 2970,
   "line": "November seventh, twenty twenty-six.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S48",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 67,
   "first": 3048,
   "line": "Mission control holds its breath.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S49",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 97,
   "first": 3115,
   "line": "At five in the morning, Eastern time, you arrive.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S50",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 3212,
   "line": "One thousand miles above the ground.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S51",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 3280,
   "line": "Close enough to feel Earth's pull.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S52",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 47,
   "first": 3348,
   "line": "Now the engine fires.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S53",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 3395,
   "line": "This is the burn that commits you.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S54",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 3451,
   "line": "Trans-Mars injection, they call it.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S55",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 47,
   "first": 3516,
   "line": "Nine minutes of thrust.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S56",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 3563,
   "line": "Earth's gravity bends your path.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S57",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 107,
   "first": 3628,
   "line": "The engine adds a push, right where gravity is strongest.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S58",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 36,
   "len": 58,
   "first": 3735,
   "line": "Two forces, working as one.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S59",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 49,
   "first": 3793,
   "line": "And then the thrust ends.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S60",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 3842,
   "line": "You are on your way to Mars.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S61",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 31,
   "len": 50,
   "first": 3894,
   "line": "Mission control erupts.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S62",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 61,
   "len": 99,
   "first": 3944,
   "line": "Nobody at NASA had ever done this before.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S63",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 4043,
   "line": "But remember, you are one of two.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S64",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 4106,
   "line": "Your twin is still coming round.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S65",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 4169,
   "line": "Two days later, same plan.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S66",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 77,
   "first": 4237,
   "line": "Monday, around six in the morning, Eastern.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S67",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 34,
   "len": 55,
   "first": 4314,
   "line": "This time, even closer.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S68",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 57,
   "first": 4369,
   "line": "Six hundred fifty miles up.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S69",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 4426,
   "line": "Another nine-minute burn.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S70",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 22,
   "len": 35,
   "first": 4474,
   "line": "Flawless again.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S71",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 63,
   "len": 102,
   "first": 4509,
   "line": "Two spacecraft. Two flybys. Two days.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S72",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 4611,
   "line": "A new way to reach Mars.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S73",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 60,
   "first": 4659,
   "line": "You can launch almost any time.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S74",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 4719,
   "line": "Then park, wait, and slingshot.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S75",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 77,
   "len": 124,
   "first": 4788,
   "line": "No more waiting for the planets to line up every two years.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S76",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 51,
   "first": 4912,
   "line": "Now comes the quiet part.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S77",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 26,
   "len": 42,
   "first": 4963,
   "line": "Ten months of coasting.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S78",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 71,
   "len": 115,
   "first": 5005,
   "line": "No engine. No drama. Just falling toward Mars.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S79",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 5120,
   "line": "You still work on the way.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S80",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 90,
   "first": 5172,
   "line": "The solar wind is changing between here and Mars.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S81",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 5262,
   "line": "A stream of particles, a million miles an hour.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S82",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 5351,
   "line": "A few small nudges keep you on course.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S83",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 59,
   "first": 5431,
   "line": "Each one has to be precise.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S84",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 5490,
   "line": "Because Mars will not wait.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S85",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 5566,
   "line": "September seventh, twenty twenty-seven.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S86",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 27,
   "len": 43,
   "first": 5642,
   "line": "Mars fills the window.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S87",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 25,
   "len": 40,
   "first": 5685,
   "line": "Now you have to slow down.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S88",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 5725,
   "line": "Another burn. About eleven minutes.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S89",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 5800,
   "line": "Get it wrong, and you sail straight past.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S90",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 5872,
   "line": "Get it right, and Mars catches you.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S91",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 5937,
   "line": "Your twin does the same, two days later.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S92",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 6013,
   "line": "Two small craft, circling the Red Planet.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S93",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 6098,
   "line": "Then the real work begins.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S94",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 67,
   "len": 108,
   "first": 6154,
   "line": "Science starts around June twenty twenty-eight.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S95",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 6262,
   "line": "So what is the mission actually for?",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S96",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 62,
   "first": 6330,
   "line": "Mars used to have a thick atmosphere.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S97",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 6392,
   "line": "The solar wind may have stripped it away.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S98",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 6460,
   "line": "Two spacecraft, in two places, at once.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S99",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 54,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 6544,
   "line": "One out near the wind. One close to the planet.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S100",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 6631,
   "line": "Watching Mars respond in real time.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S101",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 6703,
   "line": "That helps us plan for the first humans there.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S102",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 6781,
   "line": "So back to that moment.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S103",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 57,
   "len": 92,
   "first": 6829,
   "line": "Engine on. Nine minutes. Earth's pull.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S104",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 60,
   "first": 6921,
   "line": "And a planet you have never visited.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S105",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 6981,
   "line": "Earth gave you a push. Mars is next.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S106",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 7066,
   "line": "Would you have taken the slingshot?",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S107",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 84,
   "len": 135,
   "first": 7122,
   "line": "Tomorrow: another what if, another piece of the sky.",
   "note": "ch9"
  }
 ],
 "fx": [],
